{"id":"vd-a2-the-school-radio-show","level":"a2","n":20,"title":{"en":"In My Opinion…","vi":"Theo tớ thì…"},"summary":"Khách mời vắng mặt, Priya mời các bạn vào phòng phát thanh nêu ý kiến về bữa trưa ở trường — và trận tranh luận bắt đầu.","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-a2-the-school-radio-show","level":"a2","title":{"en":"The School Radio Show","vi":"Chương trình phát thanh của trường"}},"scene":{"background":"office","props":[{"id":"microphone","x":800,"y":760}]},"cast":{"priya":{"name":{"en":"Priya","vi":"Priya"},"look":"teengirl","x":520,"style":{"hair":"long","hairColor":"#1F1A1C","skin":"#B07650","skinShade":"#94603E","outfit":"jacket","top":"#8C7BC2","topShade":"#7666AD"}},"jade":{"name":{"en":"Jade","vi":"Jade"},"look":"teengirl","x":1080,"style":{"hair":"bob","hairColor":"#E0B45C","outfit":"uniform","top":"#E5484D","topShade":"#C73A3F"},"from":4,"until":9},"omar":{"name":{"en":"Omar","vi":"Omar"},"look":"teenboy","x":1180,"style":{"hair":"short","hairColor":"#1F1A1C","skin":"#C98E68","skinShade":"#B07650","outfit":"uniform","top":"#3F7FCB","topShade":"#2F66AA"},"from":10}},"lines":[{"speaker":"priya","en":"Welcome back to Radio Hill! Our guest isn't here.","vi":"Chào mừng các bạn trở lại với Radio Hill! Khách mời của chúng tôi chưa tới.","ipa":["ˈwɛlkəm","bæk","tu","ˈɹeɪdiˌoʊ","hɪl","ˈaʊɚ","ɡɛst","ˈɪzənt","hiɹ"],"start":0.554,"end":4.214,"expression":"worried","timing":[[0,0.554],[1,0.903],[2,1.161],[3,1.311],[4,1.786],[5,2.751],[6,2.941],[7,3.349],[8,3.675]]},{"speaker":"priya","en":"So today, we have a question for you.","vi":"Vậy nên hôm nay chúng tôi có một câu hỏi cho các bạn.","ipa":["soʊ","təˈdeɪ","wi","hæv","ə","ˈkwɛstʃən","fɔɹ","ju"],"start":4.754,"end":6.764,"gesture":"explain","prop":"microphone","timing":[[0,4.754],[1,4.919],[2,5.3],[3,5.449],[4,5.626],[5,5.707],[6,6.251],[7,6.495]]},{"speaker":"priya","en":"What do you think about school lunches?","vi":"Các bạn nghĩ gì về bữa trưa ở trường?","ipa":["wʌt","du","ju","θɪŋk","əˈbaʊt","skul","ˈlʌntʃɪz"],"start":7.304,"end":9.154,"gesture":"explain","prop":"microphone","timing":[[0,7.304],[1,7.388],[2,7.469],[3,7.592],[4,7.823],[5,8.122],[6,8.461]]},{"speaker":"priya","en":"Come to the radio room and tell us!","vi":"Hãy đến phòng phát thanh và cho chúng tôi biết nhé!","ipa":["kʌm","tu","ðə","ˈɹeɪdiˌoʊ","ɹum","ənd","tɛl","ʌs"],"start":9.694,"end":11.634,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,9.694],[1,9.877],[2,10.012],[3,10.148],[4,10.61],[5,10.855],[6,10.963],[7,11.262]]},{"speaker":"jade","en":"Hi! Can I say something?","vi":"Chào cậu! Tớ nói được không?","ipa":["haɪ","kæn","aɪ","seɪ","ˈsʌmθɪŋ"],"start":12.424,"end":14.104,"expression":"shy","timing":[[0,12.424],[1,13.049],[2,13.242],[3,13.362],[4,13.614]]},{"speaker":"priya","en":"Of course! What's your name, and what do you think?","vi":"Tất nhiên rồi! Cậu tên gì, và cậu nghĩ sao?","ipa":["ʌv","kɔɹs","wʌts","jɔɹ","neɪm","ənd","wʌt","du","ju","θɪŋk"],"start":14.894,"end":17.564,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,14.894],[1,14.94],[2,15.796],[3,16.054],[4,16.19],[5,16.57],[6,16.706],[7,16.883],[8,16.964],[9,17.087]]},{"speaker":"jade","en":"I'm Jade. In my opinion, the pizza is great.","vi":"Tớ là Jade. Theo tớ thì pizza rất ngon.","ipa":["aɪm","dʒeɪd","ɪn","maɪ","əˈpɪnjən","ðə","ˈpitsə","ɪz","ɡɹeɪt"],"start":18.354,"end":21.684,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,18.354],[1,18.535],[2,19.326],[3,19.542],[4,19.71],[5,20.432],[6,20.54],[7,21.009],[8,21.189]]},{"speaker":"jade","en":"But I think the soup is awful.","vi":"Nhưng tớ nghĩ món súp dở tệ.","ipa":["bʌt","aɪ","θɪŋk","ðə","sup","ɪz","ˈɑfəl"],"start":22.224,"end":23.724,"expression":"angry","timing":[[0,22.224],[1,22.427],[2,22.547],[3,22.739],[4,22.835],[5,23.052],[6,23.184]]},{"speaker":"priya","en":"Awful? Why?","vi":"Dở tệ á? Sao vậy?","ipa":["ˈɑfəl","waɪ"],"start":24.514,"end":25.784,"expression":"surprised","timing":[[0,24.514],[1,25.444]]},{"speaker":"jade","en":"It has no taste. It's like hot water!","vi":"Nó chẳng có vị gì. Như nước nóng ấy!","ipa":["ɪt","hæz","noʊ","teɪst","ɪts","laɪk","hɑt","ˈwɔtɚ"],"start":26.574,"end":29.044,"gesture":"shrug","timing":[[0,26.574],[1,26.63],[2,26.847],[3,27.015],[4,27.914],[5,28.131],[6,28.335],[7,28.599]]},{"speaker":"omar","en":"I disagree. I think the soup is fine.","vi":"Tớ không đồng ý. Tớ thấy súp cũng được mà.","ipa":["aɪ","dɪsəˈɡɹi","aɪ","θɪŋk","ðə","sup","ɪz","faɪn"],"start":29.834,"end":32.564,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,29.834],[1,29.887],[2,31.042],[3,31.137],[4,31.382],[5,31.49],[6,31.844],[7,32.02]]},{"speaker":"priya","en":"Interesting! Why do you disagree?","vi":"Thú vị đấy! Vì sao cậu không đồng ý?","ipa":["ˈɪntɹəstɪŋ","waɪ","du","ju","dɪsəˈɡɹi"],"start":33.354,"end":35.744,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,33.354],[1,34.518],[2,34.695],[3,34.79],[4,34.912]]},{"speaker":"omar","en":"It's healthy. It just needs more salt.","vi":"Nó tốt cho sức khoẻ. Chỉ cần thêm chút muối thôi.","ipa":["ɪts","ˈhɛlθi","ɪt","dʒʌst","nidz","mɔɹ","sɔlt"],"start":36.534,"end":39.094,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,36.534],[1,36.634],[2,37.572],[3,37.708],[4,37.952],[5,38.305],[6,38.55]]},{"speaker":"priya","en":"So you agree that it has no taste?","vi":"Vậy là cậu đồng ý rằng nó nhạt?","ipa":["soʊ","ju","əˈɡɹi","ðæt","ɪt","hæz","noʊ","teɪst"],"start":39.884,"end":42.024,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,39.884],[1,39.999],[2,40.23],[3,40.624],[4,40.801],[5,40.91],[6,41.195],[7,41.399]]},{"speaker":"omar","en":"Well… yes, I agree about that!","vi":"Thì… ừ, cái đó thì tớ đồng ý!","ipa":["wɛl","jɛs","aɪ","əˈɡɹi","əˈbaʊt","ðæt"],"start":42.814,"end":45.124,"expression":"shy","timing":[[0,42.814],[1,43.761],[2,44.128],[3,44.277],[4,44.576],[5,44.861]]},{"speaker":"priya","en":"What a lively discussion! What do you think, listeners?","vi":"Một cuộc thảo luận thật sôi nổi! Các bạn thính giả nghĩ sao?","ipa":["wʌt","ə","ˈlaɪvli","dɪˈskʌʃən","wʌt","du","ju","θɪŋk","ˈlɪsənɚz"],"start":45.914,"end":49.204,"expression":"happy","gesture":"cheer","react":{"omar":"happy"},"timing":[[0,45.914],[1,46.056],[2,46.137],[3,46.64],[4,47.876],[5,47.999],[6,48.08],[7,48.216],[8,48.529]]}],"words":[{"id":"opinion","en":"opinion","ipa":"əˈpɪnjən","vi":"ý kiến; quan điểm","level":1},{"id":"agree","en":"agree","ipa":"əˈɡɹi","vi":"đồng ý; nhất trí; tán thành","level":0},{"id":"disagree","en":"disagree","ipa":"dɪsəˈɡɹi","vi":"không đồng ý; bất đồng","level":1},{"id":"awful","en":"awful","ipa":"ˈɑfəl","vi":"kinh khủng; tồi tệ","level":1},{"id":"salt","en":"salt","ipa":"sɔlt","vi":"muối; ướp muối","level":1},{"id":"lively","en":"lively","ipa":"ˈlaɪvli","vi":"sôi nổi; sinh động; náo nhiệt","level":1}],"focus":{"title":"Nêu ý kiến, đồng tình và phản đối","pattern":"I think… · In my opinion, … · I agree / I disagree. · What do you think?","explain":"Nêu ý kiến: \"I think…\", \"In my opinion, …\". Hỏi ý người khác: \"What do you think?\". Đồng ý: \"I agree.\" Phản đối lịch sự: \"I disagree.\" / \"I'm not sure about that.\"","keys":["i think","in my opinion","i agree","i disagree","what do you think"],"lines":[2,5,6,7,10,14,15]},"audio":{"src":"/audio/library/videos/vd-a2-the-school-radio-show.mp3","v":"092d6267cf","duration":50.304,"fps":25,"mouth":""}}